FatQat CUDA backend

This product is a fork of FatQat (https://github.com/spaceqat/fatqat),
developed by the FatQat authors and licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0. The FatQat source, documentation and tests are their work.

This fork adds a CUDA engine for the FatQat simulator (statevector,
density-matrix, unitary and superoperator execution on NVIDIA GPUs through
CuPy), cache and shared-memory gate tiles for the Numba and CUDA engines,
exact circuit simplification, multi-GPU parameter sweeps, an Apple-GPU
(Metal) prototype, and their tests, benchmarks and documentation.
